# An expression is text: a number where a HEL expression belongs is rejected whether or not the
# datatype is one the expression properties accept.
# expect: ex:F bddo:RangeDatatypeShape sh:NodeConstraintComponent
@prefix ex:   <https://hexplain.io/test/hel-expression-invalid#> .
@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix bddo: <https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#> .

ex:F a bddo:Field ; bddo:dataType bddo:bytes ; bddo:sizeFromExpression 4 .
